# Arc's theme editor ticks (a generic haptic) as the intensity slider crosses each tenth and as the
# grain dial crosses each fifth (Arc 1.173.1's SpaceStyleEditor). Cra's played none.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x900
wait 1
cra://debug?themeEditor=1
wait 1
# The slider: inside one tenth nothing, across 0.5 one tick, and one for a long drag over several.
cra://debug?themeEditor=intensity:0.43
wait 0.5
cra://debug?themeEditor=intensity:0.47
expect-log theme editor intensity 0\.47: ticks \+0
cra://debug?themeEditor=intensity:0.53
expect-log theme editor intensity 0\.53: ticks \+1
cra://debug?themeEditor=intensity:0.58
expect-log theme editor intensity 0\.58: ticks \+0
cra://debug?themeEditor=intensity:0.92
expect-log theme editor intensity 0\.92: ticks \+1
# The dial's steps are twice as far apart.
cra://debug?themeEditor=noise:0.25
wait 0.5
cra://debug?themeEditor=noise:0.35
expect-log theme editor noise 0\.35: ticks \+0
cra://debug?themeEditor=noise:0.45
expect-log theme editor noise 0\.45: ticks \+1
cra://dismiss
